        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1356_4705.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unnser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründtlich</unclear> willig <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dinnst</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> was wir
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eheren</unclear> liebs <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> guots vermögend, zuovor, from,
<lb n="3"/>fürsichtig <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ehrsam</unclear> wyß, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">innsonders</unclear> guot fründt, und
<lb n="4"/>gethrüw lieb eydtgnossen. Wir
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werdent</unclear> von der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnseren</unclear> <persName resp="#ner">Adelheita <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Rinderknecht</unclear></persName>
<lb n="6"/>bürtig von <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Fluntern</unclear></placeName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">znechst</unclear> vor unnser statt
<lb n="7"/>alhie, mit bystandt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ieres</unclear> bruoders, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">berichtet</unclear>
<lb n="8"/>Als dann sy <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rinderknechtin</unclear></persName> zuo <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-112" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Straßburg</placeName> sich dienstts-
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wyße</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">enthallten</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">habe</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üwer</unclear> burger <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Baschian</unclear>
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Teschler</unclear></persName> der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">träyer</unclear>, der auch alda gedienet, sy <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ge</unclear>-
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">reigt</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">endlich</unclear> zur <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eh</unclear> genomen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">daruf</unclear> sy mit
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dem</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fürgäben</unclear> sy zuo <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kilchen</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">straßen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zefueren</unclear> beredt,
<lb n="13"/>das sy mit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ime</unclear> dadannen hinweg gezogen. Als <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear>
<lb n="14"/>aber sich von <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">iro</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">inn</unclear> üwer statt als syn heimat begäben,
<lb n="15"/>sye <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachgents</unclear> syn Teschlers schwöster <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wibratha</unclear></persName>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alher</unclear>
<lb n="16"/>khomen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anzeigende</unclear>, syner <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">elteren</unclear> will nit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">were</unclear>,
<lb n="17"/>das er sy <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Rinderknechtin</unclear></persName> zur <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eh</unclear> haben sölte, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deßen</unclear>
<lb n="18"/>sy <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">treffentlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beschwert</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Inmaßen</unclear> die sach
<lb n="19"/>vor etwas tagen für unnser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehgricht</unclear> khomen,
<lb n="20"/><persName resp="#ner">Alda</persName> die bemelte <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Basch</unclear> Teschlers schwöster, von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ires</unclear>
<lb n="21"/>bruoders wegen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eines</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ufschags</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begeret</unclear>, mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verspruch</unclear>
<lb n="22"/>denselben alhie <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inns</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">recht</unclear> zestellen, und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">daruf</unclear>
<lb n="23"/>auch sy <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wibratha</unclear></persName> domaln vor <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnserem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehgricht</unclear>
<lb n="24"/>angelobt, genannten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ieren</unclear> bruoder uff <date resp="#ner">gestrigen tag</date>
<lb n="25"/>als <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gwonlichen</unclear> grichtstag, für unnser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehgricht</unclear> zum
<lb n="26"/>rechten zestellen, da aber weder er
<lb n="27"/><persName resp="#ner">Teschler</persName> noch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jemands</unclear> von <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">synetwegen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erschinen</unclear> sye
<lb n="28"/>unnd hat demnach <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">genannte</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rinderknechtin</unclear></persName> sambt
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ierem</unclear> bystandt unns <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hierinnen</unclear> umb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rat</unclear>, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hilf</unclear>
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angerüfft</unclear>. Wann nun wir sy
<lb n="31"/>inn <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ierem</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fürbringen</unclear> verhört, und das vorerzelt
<lb n="32"/>anloben also beschechen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">syn</unclear>: verstanden, da
<lb n="33"/>so ist <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hierüber</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnser</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fründtlichs</unclear> gesinnen und
<lb n="34"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begären</unclear> an üch. Ir wellint gedachten
<lb n="35"/><persName resp="#ner">Teschler</persName> und syn schwöster dahin halten, das
<lb n="36"/>sy <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lut</unclear> krafft <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">iers</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">versprechens</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anlobens</unclear>
<lb n="37"/>uff <origDate resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Mentag</unclear> den 18 <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ten</unclear> diß louffenden monats</origDate>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1356_4706.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="38"/>Septembris, uff unserem <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">richthuß</unclear> alhie erschynind,
<lb n="39"/>und der gesagten <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Rinderknechtin</unclear> uff Ir klag vor
<lb n="40"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unserm</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eegricht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Inn</unclear> rechten als sich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gebuert</unclear>
<lb n="41"/>bscheid und antwort <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gaebind</unclear>. Wirt Inen
<lb n="42"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alda</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guot</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gebuerlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuerderlich</unclear> recht ervolgen.
<lb n="43"/>Das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">woellend</unclear> wir gegen üch und den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üweren</unclear>
<lb n="44"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Inn</unclear> glychen und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">annderen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">faelen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erwiederen</unclear> und
<lb n="45"/>beschulden. Unns <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sambtlich</unclear> daby <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Inn</unclear>
<lb n="46"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">goetlichen</unclear> schirm <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bevelchende</unclear>. Datum den
<lb n="47"/><origDate when="1598-09-08" cert="medium" resp="#ner">8 <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ten</unclear> Septembris, Anno 98</origDate>.
<lb n="48"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-503" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Burgermeister und rath
<lb n="49"/>der statt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Zuerich</unclear></orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1356_4707.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1356_4708.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="50"/>Den frommen fürsichtigen ehr-
<lb n="51"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">samen</unclear> wyßen. <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burgermeister
<lb n="52"/>und rath der statt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Sanck</unclear> Gallen</orgName>
<lb n="53"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßeren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inßonders</unclear> guoten fründ-
<lb n="54"/>en und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrüwen</unclear> lieben
<lb n="55"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eydtgnoßen.∣</unclear>
</p>
